<title>FINLAND: Finnish July export prices fall 2.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish July export prices fall 2.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices rose 0.8 percent in July on June but fell 2.0 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland (SF) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated import prices rose 1.4 percent in July on June and rose 1.5 percent year-on-year, SF said in a statement.</p>
<p>Export prices:</p>
<p>		July 1997	  June 1997	July 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth     +0.8 pct	   +0.1 pct	 -1.4 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	 -2.0 pct	   -4.1 pct	 -0.3 pct @</p>
<p>Import prices:</p>
<p>		July 1997	  June 1997	July 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth     +1.4 pct	   -0.3 pct	 +0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	 +1.5 pct	   +0.2 pct	 +2.2 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
